<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Thursday's match:</p>
<p>18 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>14 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>13 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>11 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), John Robertson (Hearts)</p>
<p>9 - Ally McCoist (Rangers), Brian Laudrup (Rangers),</p>
<p>Gerry Britton (Dunfermline), Erik Bo Andersen</p>
<p>(Rangers), Kjell Olafsson (Dundee United).</p>
